# 11. DETERMINISTIC POLICY ENGINE

Keep the existing `policyEngine.ts` as a base and refactor it.

A policy engine is a deterministic business-rule component, not an AI-generated decision.

Implement versioned merchant policies.

## Required policy fields

- Refund request window.
- Date basis: transaction or verified delivery.
- Covered complaint categories.
