## Complaint-specific rules

### Damaged item

Check:

- Customer-reported damage.
- Product photo received.
- Packaging photo required if merchant policy says so.
- Order verification.
- Return inspection requirement.
- Policy window.
- Any available independent delivery information.

AI observations may describe the image but cannot prove when damage occurred.

### Wrong item

Check:

- Order item SKU.
- Received item label or barcode where supplied.
- Product photo.
- Packaging photo where required.
- Mapping between purchased and received product.

